.IX Title "Lucy::Search::IndexSearcher 3pm"
.TH Lucy::Search::IndexSearcher 3pm 2026-09-16 "perl v5.40.1" "User Contributed Perl Documentation"
.\" For nroff, turn off justification.  Always turn off hyphenation; it makes
.\" way too many mistakes in technical documents.
.if n .ad l
.nh
.SH NAME
Lucy::Search::IndexSearcher \- Execute searches against a single index.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.IX Header "SYNOPSIS"
.Vb 8
\&    my $searcher = Lucy::Search::IndexSearcher\->new( 
\&        index => \*(Aq/path/to/index\*(Aq 
\&    );
\&    my $hits = $searcher\->hits(
\&        query      => \*(Aqfoo bar\*(Aq,
\&        offset     => 0,
\&        num_wanted => 100,
\&    );
.Ve
.SH DESCRIPTION
.IX Header "DESCRIPTION"
Use the IndexSearcher class to perform search queries against an index.
(For searching multiple indexes at once, see
PolySearcher).
.PP
IndexSearchers operate against a single point-in-time view or
Snapshot of the index.  If an index is
modified, a new IndexSearcher must be opened to access the changes.
.SH CONSTRUCTORS
.IX Header "CONSTRUCTORS"
.SS new
.IX Subsection "new"
.Vb 3
\&    my $searcher = Lucy::Search::IndexSearcher\->new( 
\&        index => \*(Aq/path/to/index\*(Aq 
\&    );
.Ve
.PP
Create a new IndexSearcher.
.IP \(bu 4
\&\fBindex\fR \- Either a string filepath, a Folder, or an IndexReader.
.SH METHODS
.IX Header "METHODS"
.SS doc_max
.IX Subsection "doc_max"
.Vb 1
\&    my $int = $index_searcher\->doc_max();
.Ve
.PP
Return the maximum number of docs in the collection represented by the
Searcher, which is also the highest possible internal doc id.
Documents which have been marked as deleted but not yet purged are
included in this count.
.SS doc_freq
.IX Subsection "doc_freq"
.Vb 4
\&    my $int = $index_searcher\->doc_freq(
\&        field => $field,  # required
\&        term  => $term,   # required
\&    );
.Ve
.PP
Return the number of documents which contain the term in the given
field.
.IP \(bu 4
\&\fBfield\fR \- Field name.
.IP \(bu 4
\&\fBterm\fR \- The term to look up.
.SS collect
.IX Subsection "collect"
.Vb 4
\&    $index_searcher\->collect(
\&        query     => $query,      # required
\&        collector => $collector,  # required
\&    );
.Ve
.PP
Iterate over hits, feeding them into a
Collector.
.IP \(bu 4
\&\fBquery\fR \- A Query.
.IP \(bu 4
\&\fBcollector\fR \- A Collector.
.SS fetch_doc
.IX Subsection "fetch_doc"
.Vb 1
\&    my $hit_doc = $index_searcher\->fetch_doc($doc_id);
.Ve
.PP
Retrieve a document.  Throws an error if the doc id is out of range.
.IP \(bu 4
\&\fBdoc_id\fR \- A document id.
.SS get_reader
.IX Subsection "get_reader"
.Vb 1
\&    my $index_reader = $index_searcher\->get_reader();
.Ve
.PP
Accessor for the object’s \f(CW\*(C`reader\*(C'\fR member.
.SH INHERITANCE
.IX Header "INHERITANCE"
Lucy::Search::IndexSearcher isa Lucy::Search::Searcher isa Clownfish::Obj.
